AI scale.\n\n[Learn more](https://www.twelvelabs.io/product/analyze)\n\n![Graphic](https://framerusercontent.com/images/PoLwNMYfvjKB8TiuwZvTCKTO0.png?width=1440&height=892)\n\n# Pegasus is reaching ever-higher peaks.\n\n![Image](https://framerusercontent.com/images/a3rZ8EwhZBEg4D39dvYy9hcVUGM.png?lossless=1&width=1920&height=1080)\n\nWhat’s new\n\n## Pegasus’ latest frontiers.\n\n[![Building Pegasus 1.5: From Clip-Based QA to Time-Based Metadata — Thumbnail](https://framerusercontent.com/images/vjne4CkTndBiJt2JgW9oPALmU.png?width=9600&height=5040)\\\\\n\\\\\nBuilding Pegasus 1.5: From Clip-Based QA to Time-Based Metadata](https://www.twelvelabs.io/blog/introducing-pegasus-1-5) [![Pegasus 1.2: An Industry-Grade Video Language Model for Scalable Applications — Thumbnail](https://framerusercontent.com/images/5BL3u8keQ1VbuSvNlo1lc1Zx3lw.png?width=770&height=512)\\\\\n\\\\\nPegasus 1.2: An Industry-Grade Video Language Model for Scalable Applications](https://www.twelvelabs.io/blog/introducing-pegasus-1-2)\n\n## We’re fundamentally transforming how people see, experience and use video through AI.\n\nGrounded in research and knowledge sharing, we’re learning and growing alongside our partners, with consideration for the future.\n\n[Our Research](https://www.twelvelabs.io/research)\n\n[A Joint Sequence Fusion Model for Video Question Answering and Retrieval\\\\\n\\\\\nECCV 2018, 1st place in LSMDC challenge in ICCV 2017](https://arxiv.org/abs/1808.02559) [AdaCoF: Adaptive Collaboration of Flows for Video Frame Interpolation\\\\\n\\\\\nCVPR 2020](https://openaccess.thecvf.com/content_CVPR_2020/html/Lee_AdaCoF_Adaptive_Collaboration_of_Flows_for_Video_Frame_Interpolation_CVPR_2020_paper.html) [Character Grounding and Re-Identification in Story of Videos and Text Descriptions\\\\\n\\\\\nECCV 2020, 1st place in LSMDC challenge in ICCV 2019](https://www.ecva.net/papers/eccv_2020/papers_ECCV/papers/123500528.pdf)\n\n![Cover CTA](https://framerusercontent.com/images/k3W9QoeYoTSGSClF27ZxpxI4.png?width=4200&height=1101)\n\n### No one sees your video like TwelveLabs.\n\nSee for yourself what our AI can do - try one of your videos in our Playground.\n\n[Try Free](https://playground.twelvelabs.io/)\n\n[Talk to Sales](https://www.twelvelabs.io/contact)\n\n![Desktop](https://framerusercontent.com/images/9PG6e3JXFou0b275rmkrCHk6oE.svg?width=1680&height=854)\n\n**Platform**\n\n[Platform Overview](https://www.twelvelabs.io/product/product-overview)\n\n[Models Overview](https://www.twelvelabs.io/product/models-overview)\n\n[Jockey](https://www.twelvelabs.io/jockey)\n\n[Compliance](https://www.twelvelabs.io/compliance)\n\n**Enterprise**\n\n[Overview](https://www.twelvelabs.io/enterprise)\n\n[Case Studies](https://www.twelvelabs.io/case-studies)\n\n[Partners](https://www.twelvelabs.io/partners)\n\n[Security](https://www.twelvelabs.io/security)\n\n**Developers**\n\n[API Docs](https://docs.twelvelabs.io/docs/get-started/introduction)\n\n[SDKs](https://docs.twelvelabs.io/docs/resources/twelve-labs-sd-ks)\n\n[Discord](https://discord.com/invite/mwHQKFv7En)\n\n[Developer Hub](https://www.twelvelabs.io/developer-hub)\n\n[Sample Apps](https://www.twelvelabs.io/sample-apps)\n\n[Research](https://www.twelvelabs.io/research)\n\n[**Legal**](https://www.twelvelabs.io/legal)\n\n[Website Terms](https://www.twelvelabs.io/legal/website-terms)\n\n[Terms of Use](https://www.twelvelabs.io/legal/terms-of-use)\n\n[Enterprise Terms of Service](https://www.twelvelabs.io/legal/tos)\n\n[Privacy Policy](https://www.twelvelabs.io/legal/privacy-policy)\n\n[Trust Center](https://trust.twelvelabs.io/?_gl=1*1ttnbg3*_gcl_au*MjA0OTg2NjgxOS4xNzcwNzIyNDU5LjU4Mjg2NDU5NC4xNzcyODExNjA5LjE3NzI4MTE2MDk.*_ga*MTg3NTA3NzYzNC4xNzYyNjQ5NDQy*_ga_END0TB2RFD*czE3NzU2NDcyOTAkbzk1JGcxJHQxNzc1NjQ4ODcyJGoyJGwwJGgw)\n\n[Additional Legal Resources](https://www.twelvelabs.io/legal)\n\n**Capabilities**\n\n[Embed](https://www.twelvelabs.io/product/embed)\n\n[Search](https://www.twelvelabs.io/product/video-sea